      {
        "description": "Dyslexia status (binary): 1 indicates reader has dyslexia, 0 indicates no dyslexia. This is the moderator of the effect of reader_view; the research question asks whether the effect of reader_view differs for participants with dyslexia.",
        "is_moderator": true,
